# //// Neoffice - .idea/ dropped from the repository (2026-09-04). The folder had been committed
# //// by mistake (d70a6fb2e, 2024-02-23) and .idea/misc.xml advertised a real production host and
# //// login (root@demo.neoffice.me:22). It is per-developer editor state; upstream ships none.
.idea/

dist/
mobile/dev-dist
# //// Neoffice - commit-the-build (e47b794fe, 2026-05-07 "build(frontend): commit built frontend so instances pull, no rebuild on prod").
# //// Upstream ignores the vite output and rebuilds on every instance; `yarn build` OOM-kills a
# //// 4 GB Neoffice instance, so GitHub Actions builds it and the artefacts are committed. The
# //// three paths are commented out rather than deleted so the diff against upstream stays legible.

# 2026-05-07 (NORA #28) — frontend build outputs are committed on this branch.
# See docs/COMMIT-BUILD-PATTERN.md in neoffice-devops.
# (Raven writes vite output to public/raven/ and public/raven_v3/, not
# public/frontend/, see vite.config.ts --base=/assets/raven/raven/.)
# raven/public/raven
# raven/public/raven_v3
raven/public/node_modules
# //// Neoffice - commit-the-build (e47b794fe, 2026-05-07 "build(frontend): commit built frontend so instances pull, no rebuild on prod"): raven/www/raven.html is committed too,
# //// for the same reason as the assets above. raven_v3 is kept commented out with it - that
# //// variant is not built today.
# raven/www/raven.html
# raven/www/raven_v3.html
*.env

# Native folders generated by expo prebuild
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/.expo

# //// Neoffice - the two lines below. apps/web/.env.local is upstream's, unchanged - it only shows
# //// in the diff because upstream leaves the file without a trailing newline. The CLAUDE.md rule
# //// under it is ours (bc9617b4e, 2026-05-07 "docs(claude): unship CLAUDE.md and document
# //// commit-the-build pipeline"): CLAUDE.md is SHIPPED, not ignored, because it documents the
# //// build pipeline and the Frappe Shell Native integration that the next person needs.
apps/web/.env.local
# CLAUDE.md  # 2026-05-07 unshipped to document commit-the-build pipeline
